.\" Man page for rsvp-tui
.TH RSVP-TUI 1 "2026-06-12" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rsvp-tui \- Rapid Serial Visual Presentation terminal ebook reader
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rsvp-tui
[\fIfile\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBrsvp-tui\fR displays a text file one word at a time in the centre of the terminal, using the RSVP technique to speed reading. It features a modal interface with Vim‑style key bindings, chapter and paragraph navigation, and Optimal Recognition Point (ORP) colour highlighting.
.SH OPTIONS
\fIfile\fR
.RS
Path to a plain text file to read.
.RE
.SH MODES
.TP
\fBAuto mode\fR (default)
Words advance automatically at the specified words‑per‑minute (WPM) rate.
.TP
\fBManual mode\fR
Words advance only when you press \fBj\fR or \fBk\fR.
.SH KEY BINDINGS
.SS Global
.TP
\fBq\fR
Quit the program.
.TP
\fB?\fR
Show help panel.
.TP
\fBm\fR
Toggle between Auto and Manual mode.
.TP
\fBCtrl+j\fR
Jump to next paragraph (shows overview).
.TP
\fBCtrl+k\fR
Jump to previous paragraph (shows overview).
.TP
\fB]\fR
Jump to next chapter (shows overview).
.TP
\fB[\fR
Jump to previous chapter (shows overview).
.SS Auto mode
.TP
\fB+\fR or \fBk\fR
Increase WPM by 10.
.TP
\fB\-\fR or \fBj\fR
Decrease WPM by 10.
.TP
\fBSpace\fR or \fBp\fR
Pause / resume.
.SS Manual mode
.TP
\fBj\fR
Next word.
.TP
\fBk\fR
Previous word.
.TP
\fB+\fR
Increase WPM by 10.
.TP
\fB\-\fR
Decrease WPM by 10.
.SH FEATURES
- Centred word display with ORP letter highlighted in yellow (if terminal supports colour).
- Real‑time progress bar, WPM and ETA display.
- Chapter and paragraph navigation with content overview.
- Punctuation pause (1.5× delay after sentences).
- Resume prompt on startup (via bookmark file).
- Non‑blocking input for responsive controls.
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/yourname/rsvp-tui
.SH AUTHOR
Written by yourname <email@example.com>
